      "id": 18999,
      "name": "Missingno",
      "username": "Missingno",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-05T05:29:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Super fitting name if you ask me, though I feel like I'm missing a refrence.&nbsp; Operative, La Capitan, Miss Information, and Friction against Legacy, K.N.Y.F.E, Tempest, and Ra.&nbsp; Mint on Tempest Turn 3 at 11/11/14/10.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This party has a severe lack of ongoing destruction and ball lightning is a bit deep in Tempest's deck, so it's best to nuke Miss Information as soon as you can before she can get out anything nasty, though use that Take Down you got first to stop Heroes Unalinged from playing the top card of her deck first.&nbsp; Aside from that use the high damage AoEs you got to cleave through the team.&nbsp; I went Miss Info, then Friction who died to a behemoth, and then La Capitan and Operative died on the same turn.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:32.142Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
