      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-05T13:24:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy indeed! The Mint came so naturally, I was afraid I'd done something wrong! It's one of those games where even if you don't play optimally (I didn't use Take Down the first round, for instance, and so got the extra card play), you probably won't feel it.</p>\n<p>Having Chronological Hotspot play Inspiring Presence for me a turn early was nice. :)</p>",
