    {
      "id": 225859,
      "name": "“Mad Dog”",
      "username": "_Mad_Dog",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-07T19:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, this was... remarkably easy.&nbsp; Hence the title, I guess.&nbsp; First time I played this match-up everything was over before the end of the third round.&nbsp; Later on I tried it again with some slightly different tactics and won on the environment turn of round 2.&nbsp; I don't recall any other one-shot being that quick.</p>\n<p>Like others posting here, I targetted Miss Information first, and she was done before the end of the first round.&nbsp; I targetting Friction next and she took herself out on her second turn.&nbsp; The environment took out The Operative and La Capitan on its' turn on the second round.&nbsp; Hmm, just realized that the heroes only incapacitated one of the villains in this match; that's notable as well.</p>\n<p>Legacy's \"Take Down\" in round 1 was key, and KNYFE was just a damage-inflicting powerhouse.&nbsp; Do NOT pick a fight with her.</p>\n<p>Simple, but fun, one-shot.</p>\n<p>Oh, and I didn't get \"The Walking Dead\" reference either, and I've seen that episode.&nbsp; ;-(</p>",
