      "id": 225860,
      "name": "QuirkyDM",
      "username": "QuirkyDM",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-08T11:50:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I didn't play Take Down and I still thought it was easy. I could see with all the damage cards available that I could take down any villain I wanted in one round, so I hit Miss Information with everything I had. Then I saw I could take down another villain right away, and then another, and pretty soon Operative was on her own.</p>\n<p>I focused on La Capitan as the second villain because I was concerned Miss Information's incap ability would become bothersome with putting 4 cards under Chiquito every turn. Oh, and also because I had Tempest play Lightning Slash and Friction still had her Shock Dampeners out, so I went after the second best target.</p>",
